            <title>1.12.1</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 11:12:59 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>221</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.12.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>App Store updates show up sooner: every check now also asks your App Store account, so a new version appears as soon as your store has it, even while Apple&#x27;s public listing still shows the old one or doesn&#x27;t answer. Those rows say &quot;Out in your store first&quot;.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
