        <item>
            <title>1.11.1</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:37:10 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>213</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.11.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>An app you installed with Homebrew, such as DBeaver, is counted once: the &quot;Homebrew packages waiting&quot; note on Updates, the Dock badge and the menu bar no longer count it a second time as a package. The Homebrew page still lists it.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
